  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-1",
      "transcript": "This tanker reached Malta with a warship lashed to each side.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.075,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.c5f32de6ece5a6ea48789683534ebec62963a82c458924b38d1c4631a7960357",
        "sha256": "c5f32de6ece5a6ea48789683534ebec62963a82c458924b38d1c4631a7960357"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-2",
      "transcript": "It was August nineteen forty-two. Malta was under siege, and desperately short of fuel.",
      "start": 4.4,
      "duration": 5.975,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.160262352c411203bb47393fbc3928f33c48f081bb34dc7eef85bcd66065d444",
        "sha256": "160262352c411203bb47393fbc3928f33c48f081bb34dc7eef85bcd66065d444"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Ohio was carrying thousands of tons.",
      "start": 10.666666666666666,
      "duration": 2.825,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.b731c0d5abcbe1c75e04021e65b8dd2b47bc60c58a194ccbf9e548ea6c7c8c78",
        "sha256": "b731c0d5abcbe1c75e04021e65b8dd2b47bc60c58a194ccbf9e548ea6c7c8c78"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-4",
      "transcript": "A torpedo struck. Bomb attacks followed. Her engines failed, and water flooded in.",
      "start": 13.8,
      "duration": 5.825,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.85b8f8c7f9a6f5b8d32aab9ec40099c2b98754d92e6556a7bfc119389312c61b",
        "sha256": "85b8f8c7f9a6f5b8d32aab9ec40099c2b98754d92e6556a7bfc119389312c61b"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-5",
      "transcript": "Towing her was a struggle: the damaged ship kept swinging off course.",
      "start": 19.933333333333334,
      "duration": 4.3,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.de3a64c418b4e679abba8d902ed24ac11738d34bfc5420c4c89a155d5dc25f72",
        "sha256": "de3a64c418b4e679abba8d902ed24ac11738d34bfc5420c4c89a155d5dc25f72"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-6",
      "transcript": "So destroyers came alongside, securing the tanker between them, while other vessels helped with the tow.",
      "start": 24.533333333333335,
      "duration": 6.5,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.0fb5277098a6f9c72cce1a568a9427cd4bde0f784310af6a9e28d08f70910c22",
        "sha256": "0fb5277098a6f9c72cce1a568a9427cd4bde0f784310af6a9e28d08f70910c22"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-7",
      "transcript": "On August fifteenth, Ohio entered Grand Harbour.",
      "start": 31.433333333333334,
      "duration": 3.675,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.5ebd6cda67585053b23148f0dc5523626024fe72583e7239458671b137937698",
        "sha256": "5ebd6cda67585053b23148f0dc5523626024fe72583e7239458671b137937698"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-8",
      "transcript": "Her fuel was unloaded, helping Malta’s aircraft keep fighting.",
      "start": 35.5,
      "duration": 4.375,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.514fd28e23c500cb5f0138b5b1e9ea1c06de224a445e50e031e878c179f2de7a",
        "sha256": "514fd28e23c500cb5f0138b5b1e9ea1c06de224a445e50e031e878c179f2de7a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ohio-cue-9",
      "transcript": "The precious part of this wreck was still inside her.",
      "start": 40.2,
      "duration": 3.15,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.d86ac578d3c026f39e5d0d04661f75edabb0e22ae6b2994fb0e8589ebd2391f7",
        "sha256": "d86ac578d3c026f39e5d0d04661f75edabb0e22ae6b2994fb0e8589ebd2391f7"
      }
    }
  ],
